OL,3,AFrench ex-President Sarkozy and wife   
OL,4,ACarla Bruni to face trial              
OL,6,FSarkozy was given a five-year sentence 
OL,7,Fin the case last September and became  
OL,8,Fthe first French ex-president to go to 
OL,9,Fjail, even though he only spent 20 days
OL,10,Fbehind bars. He has always denied doing
OL,11,Fanything wrong in the case and the     
OL,12,Fappeals verdict is expected next       
OL,13,FMonday.                                
